// prLockCoveredElsewhere records a mutex call the manifest discharges under a MORE SPECIFIC
// reviewed explanation. It is not an escape hatch: the explanation named here must be the one
// the manifest cites, and a predicate match in NEITHER map fails. Both entries are PRE-READ --
// the call is evaluated BEFORE the read, so no outcome of the read can reach it, which is a
// stronger claim than LOCK's and is the reason the reviewer chose it there.
